Output docs/assets/clips/areas-page.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Padding 10
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type `exec "$KDEMO_DIR/env.sh" herdr`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+B
Type "b"
Sleep 300ms
Ctrl+B
Type "h"
Sleep 500ms
Show

# The Areas page: every system note with its repo.
Sleep 1.2s
Type "2"
Sleep 3s
Type "j"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Type "l"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Type "1"
Sleep 1.5s
